### 1. Register a new customer account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Try registering the same email again -> expect 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Login as the customer
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Wrong password -> expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@test.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### 5. Public read endpoint — no token needed -> expect 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinemas

### 6. Admin-only action with NO token at all -> expect 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/cinemas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Cinema",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Tashkent"
}

### 7. Admin-only action with a CUSTOMER token -> expect 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/cinemas
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI1IiwiZW1haWwiOiJjdXN0b21lckB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJDVVNUT01FUiIsImV4cCI6MTc4NDcxNjg3MywiaXNzIjoiU2VhdHNSZXNlcnZhdGlvbkJhY2tlbmQiLCJhdWQiOiJTZWF0c1Jlc2VydmF0aW9uQ2xpZW50cyJ9.3-iCqPle6NrVW09vOlY5cP4GLLTuRjLk26QbwjSnfm4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Demo Cinema",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "city": "Tashkent"
}

### 8. Login as admin (run AFTER manually promoting admin@test.com in Postgres)
POST http://localhost:55134/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "@dmin-Password123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 9. Same admin-only action with an ADMIN token -> expect 201 Created
POST http://localhost:55134/cinemas
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Testing Cinema",
  "address": "987 Main Street",
  "city": "Samarkand"
}

### 10. Confirm it's now visible via the public read endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/cinemas
